From: UBOX10 Architecture Ceiling Study <noreply@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] graphics: back-deploy ARM64 mapper to VNDK 31 libc++

The retained API-31 vendor namespace supplies libc++ from the VNDK 31 APEX.
Android 16 libc++ headers otherwise emit an import of
std::__libcpp_verbose_abort, which that snapshot does not export.  Use the
libc++-documented fatal-hook override only for the ARM64 passthrough mapper.
---
 graphics/mapper/2.1/default/Android.bp                  | 7 +++++++
 graphics/mapper/2.1/default/vndk31_libcpp_backdeploy.h | 11 +++++++++++
 2 files changed, 18 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 graphics/mapper/2.1/default/vndk31_libcpp_backdeploy.h

diff --git a/graphics/mapper/2.1/default/Android.bp b/graphics/mapper/2.1/default/Android.bp
index 8dfdbbd..a85f7c9 100644
--- a/graphics/mapper/2.1/default/Android.bp
+++ b/graphics/mapper/2.1/default/Android.bp
@@ -29,6 +29,13 @@ cc_library_shared {
     vendor: true,
     relative_install_path: "hw",
     srcs: ["passthrough.cpp"],
+    arch: {
+        arm64: {
+            cflags: [
+                "-include hardware/interfaces/graphics/mapper/2.1/default/vndk31_libcpp_backdeploy.h",
+            ],
+        },
+    },
     header_libs: [
         "android.hardware.graphics.mapper@2.1-passthrough",
     ],
diff --git a/graphics/mapper/2.1/default/vndk31_libcpp_backdeploy.h b/graphics/mapper/2.1/default/vndk31_libcpp_backdeploy.h
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..a0d4847
--- /dev/null
+++ b/graphics/mapper/2.1/default/vndk31_libcpp_backdeploy.h
@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@
+/*
+ * The retained API-31 vendor namespace resolves libc++ from the VNDK 31 APEX.
+ * Android 16 libc++ headers otherwise emit a dependency on the newer
+ * std::__libcpp_verbose_abort symbol.  libc++ explicitly permits callers to
+ * override this fatal-only hook for back deployment.
+ */
+#pragma once
+
+#if defined(__aarch64__) && !defined(_LIBCPP_VERBOSE_ABORT)
+#define _LIBCPP_VERBOSE_ABORT(...) __builtin_abort()
+#endif
-- 
